            {
              "role": "user",
              "content": "=You are simulating 3 AI sources: ChatGPT, Perplexity, and Gemini. For each, simulate how they would answer this question.\n\nQuestion: {{ $json.question }}\n\nTarget brand: {{ $json.brand }}\nNiche: {{ $json.niche }}\nServices: {{ $json.services }}\nLocation: {{ $json.location }}\n\nFor each source, answer as that source would actually answer. Then provide JSON:\n{\n  \"question\": \"the question\",\n  \"sources\": [\n    {\n      \"source\": \"ChatGPT\",\n      \"mentioned_brand\": true/false,\n      \"mentioned_competitors\": [\"name1\"],\n      \"failure_reason\": \"why not mentioned\",\n      \"failure_category\": \"no_reviews / no_articles / no_forum_activity / weak_content / strong_competitor\",\n      \"fix\": \"specific actionable fix\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source\": \"Perplexity\",\n      \"mentioned_brand\": true/false,\n      \"mentioned_competitors\": [],\n      \"failure_reason\": \"\",\n      \"failure_category\": \"\",\n      \"fix\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source\": \"Gemini\",\n      \"mentioned_brand\": true/false,\n      \"mentioned_competitors\": [],\n      \"failure_reason\": \"\",\n      \"failure_category\": \"\",\n      \"fix\": \"\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\nReply with the JSON only."
            }
